    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e006c5f4a006ebe4988ba803da97e44f, type: 3}
    dialogue: This is the last circus of the Kingdom.
  - speakerName: clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e006c5f4a006ebe4988ba803da97e44f, type: 3}
    dialogue: Your role is to find our Kingdom's missing citzens by recuriting them
      to the Circus.
  - speakerName: clown
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e006c5f4a006ebe4988ba803da97e44f, type: 3}
    dialogue: Now, go find your first member.
  typingSpeed: 0.03
